@1525. Spirits who belong to a certain internal province of the face.

@1568. The charity which shines from the face is not of the face...

@1762. Spirits who... expressed their meaning by changes induced on my face...

@1925[6]. "The Angel of His faces" (Isaiah 63:9) = the Lord's mercy towards universal mankind.

@1933. "The face" = the interiors. @1999. @2327. @2434. @3527[2]. @4066. @4835[4]. @4859[end]. @4866. @5695, Explained. @8925.

