@3157[end]. When the truth of faith is received by the will... faith is of charity, or as to life is charity itself.

@3158[2]. Unless the truth of faith... is received by the good of love... it is not faith.

@3167[2]. Causes... the truth (in the natural man) to receive the rays of light, that is, faith.

@3187. "Seed" = those who are in charity through faith, that is, the spiritual.

