@6765. Chiding, because one wanted to destroy the faith of another. Signified.

@6767. Dost thou want to destroy my faith? Signified. Faith is of the Church; and these two things are so united, that he who destroys faith with anyone, destroys the Church with him; and this is to kill him; for he who takes away faith, takes away spiritual life.

@6805. That He endowed the Church with faith. Signified.

@6939. That if the Spiritual Church had not hope and faith they would be dragged down by falsities, evils, and profane things. Treated of. @6946. @6949. @6959.

