@913[end]. When there is no truth of faith, but faith without truth, "iron is mixed with clay, which do not cohere."

@937[2]. The Lord is present with everyone according to faith, and is conjoined according to love. Faith and the consequent presence of the Lord is given through the Knowledges of Truths from the Word...

