@AR 439[2]. Can fascinate the understanding... @AE 715[3].

@462[2]. This was spiritual witchcraft. Described.

@SE 3137. They were interior magicians, fascinators...

@3719[end]. They can thus fascinate men. @3723.

@5306. They fascinate a holy external before the eyes.

@DMin 4746. This is fascination, or the taking away of the power of another.

@4746. Their fascination consists in this...

@4747. They attack all they meet with their witchcrafts...

@AE 544. Not by any persuasive fascination.

@556. This speech fascinates and infatuates the minds of others...

